    checked: ['This app’s Reading Stationing & Cutsheets page and its cutsheet import (invert = stake elevation − cut, or + fill; C is always down, F always up).', 'This app’s Rod Units & Grade Math page (Engineer’s rod reading at invert = reading at stake + cut, or − fill).'],
