      answerText: 'It lays <strong>17.75 ft</strong>.', math: '18.00 − 3.00 ÷ 12 = 18.00 − 0.25 = <strong>17.75 ft</strong>',
      why: 'Convert the inches to feet first (3 ÷ 12 = 0.25), then subtract.',
