  // ================= end batch 17 END =================
  // ================= fix_endsheet (r14.3 / r15): a run's report, always reachable by its own account =================
  // Owner, Oct 21 (company pipelayer, iPhone Home Screen app): "it won't let me view the report after it's ended".
  // No role gate stops it (Records's View / Download PDF work for a pipelayer); what was missing:
  //  1. A route. Ending a run (End Run, End Run Without Completing, "Where Did This Run End?") goes Home, and Home then
  //     says nothing of it on a plan with Records; Results has no report button on that plan. Now: Home says
  //     "Run ended" with View Report and Save PDF (until Dismiss, a newer run, or another account), and Results has
