      + '<p class="pb-help">Each job’s alerts go to its assigned PMs and supers: a push right away, and one email in the morning on days something needs a look. A job with none sends them to every PM and super in the company, and to the owner only when the company has none; a plan change on a job with none goes to no one. “Send my own copies” also sends the owner a copy of every job’s alerts (plan changes only on jobs with a PM or super; off unless the owner turns it on). Quiet hours (8:55 PM to 6 AM) and the morning email follow the time zone.</p>' /* feat_office B1 */
