  // ================= batch 19 PM: NAMES (sql/02_names.sql) =================
  // A person's own name (Account & Settings > Your name; asked once on the first sign-in after joining a company, can be
  // skipped) and the name a company gives a member (Crew members: when adding, and Edit Name). Company screens show the
