  // ================= r15.1 PM RUNS: crew run records for the office =================
  // Owner (Tommy, Oct 21): a PM login could not find the run a pipelayer ran the night before anywhere. Ruling: "Runs list
  // + report": every crew run, marked waiting for the foreman or confirmed; tap one for the full run record and PDF.
  // CREW PHONE: each run in this account's Records from the last 21 days is sent to the company (pb_prod_run_record_put)
  // when it changes: the same record Records keeps, with photo and file data left out (photos stay on the phone that
  // took them). Checked every minute and when the app comes back; only for a member of a company; sent with the account
  // that owns Records, never another login. Nothing is shown to the crew about it.
  // OFFICE (company account, managers, PMs): Home has "Crew runs"; the list says who, which job, how far, and whether a
